    [("<i>I buyed</i> / <i>I thinked</i>.", "<i>bought / thought</i>."), ("Confundir <i>bought</i> (buy) e <i>brought</i> (bring).", "comprar → bought; trazer → brought."), ("<i>I knowed</i>.", "<i>I knew</i>.")],
    "<p>Em commits e changelogs, o passado aparece muito: <b>Found the bug</b>, <b>Wrote tests for the parser</b>, <b>Made the API faster</b>, <b>Took the old endpoint out</b>.</p>",
